{"ref":"BDB, עֹ֫פֶל","hw":"עֹ֫פֶל","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֹ֫פֶל</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong> [<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>mound, hill</strong>, only as acropolis;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"II Kings 5:24\" href=\"/II_Kings.5.24\">2 K 5:24</a> +, cstr. <a data-ref=\"Micah 4:8\" href=\"/Micah.4.8\">Mi 4:8</a>;—fortified mound or hill within city, of Jerus. (cf. Rob<sup>BR i. 267</sup> GuZPV<sup>v (1882), 326</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Micah 4:8\" href=\"/Micah.4.8\">Mi 4:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.14\">Is 32:14</a>; S. end of eastern hill <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:26\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.26\">Ne 3:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:21\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.21\">11:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 33:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.33.14\">2 Ch 33:14</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">חוֹמַת הָע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:27\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.27\">Ne 3:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 27:3\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.27.3\">2 Ch 27:3</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עָפַל\" href=\"/BDB,_עָפַל\", dir=\"rtl\">חמת העפל</a> in <span dir=\"rtl\">קרחה</span> MI<sup>21.22</sup>); of Samaria <a data-ref=\"II Kings 5:24\" href=\"/II_Kings.5.24\">2 K 5:24</a>.","next":"BDB, עֹ֫פֶל²","prev":"BDB, עָפַל"}